    "body": "👋 Thanks for opening this issue!\n\nI found a similar issue in our tracker that might address your problem:\n\n_[Issue weaviate/weaviate#11433: [Schema Validation] Negative `ef` value (-1) accepted in vectorIndexConfig without validation error (Closed)](https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/issues/11433)_\n\n_This closed issue is the closest match because it reports a schema validation gap where an invalid `vectorIndexConfig` value is accepted silently instead of being rejected with a 4xx error. Like your query, it concerns missing validation during `POST /v1/schema` and the server accepting bad configuration input without error._\n\nPlease check if this is the same issue. If so, consider adding your input there or closing this one. Thanks for helping us keep the issue tracker organized! 🚀\n\n---\n<div align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://tse1.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.A-2PG7j0L0X0H3M3lHuB4QHaHa\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Weaviate Logo\">\n<br>\n<sub><strong>Powered by Weaviate</strong></sub>\n</div>",
